Writing to this field sets the Even/Odd frame (EONUM) field to even frame.</description>
              <bitOffset>28</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <access>write-only</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>SODDFRM</name>
