I2SDIV can take any values except the value 1, when ODD is also equal to 1.
Refer to Section 80.9.9: Clock generator for details</description>
              <bitOffset>16</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>8</bitWidth>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
