Setting the bit clears the HRSTDISC flag in the UCPD_SR register.</description>
              <bitOffset>4</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <access>write-only</access>
              <enumeratedValues derivedFrom="TXMSGDISCCFW"/>
